<title>Somalia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/somalia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-somalia-2026-10-27T13:25:59.938Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 27 Oct 2026 13:25:59 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Somali army convoys continue to be ambushed by al-Shabaab, with recent heavy fighting near Baidoa and a stalled advance on Burhakabo, while al-Shabaab suffered significant losses in Operation Banooda and a Bay operation that reportedly killed 75 fighters. New to the situation, Fitgharan forces now control the Mogadishu-Baidoa corridor and Laftagareen forces have seized Buurhakaba and a town in Bay, extending combat in the south, and Ethiopia has withdrawn over 3,000 troops and will not intervene in the South West State conflict. The conflict has caused civilian displacement and flood risks, and 2,284 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxQNzM4S1gyZ0paSEFQWmpOLUd6WmZsclZsQ0hsVkNlaE02SjdueENSd2xPOFV6bWRyYmszN2ZFamtSUmh2b2hKUUlNWDB0MFJfX3RnQUFOZVFNMExBZUNWd1U5dHRZLUJkMDdhZlQzMVZldGRlczU4d0JCcHg1NktFcllXTjRDM1BZdU5qQVk2dW5LVE1pMHZ0LTAyTU1uYkhqOWNhYlVzS2I?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxPc0x4OF8wRmZ1bXpWV0ZQSnYybHJMSF81Q3NFUEVKa0piSzRJQkNGMXl3TmUxQlJZb181ZDZzRGkxVkpia3ZLd0VmQlFxeWNaZ01jYU5EbWQ3ampYeWFuSnpraVBMVzlCQ0hNaXhXSm5yc0d3M2h2NFBVSzR1Tm52dk4wdGNmbGJIVFVBM3lZZUtTdm8wVVBXcThB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxPcm5SbkxhX09UWHh6NjVfVWVLRDFFTUNPaWNYWmtvUVZVZmpNTzY0YUhrUXAxcmJLcUU2aDdlRmxvTHZiOWlMUWh2ZW1hdVZWQVVuQnc0SC1BY042YUlfYnF3RGxRTW1BMWduR29QUEhOTEdJUmJRNWZKQW1uX2pfTGRyaXlPNmJZZzFpd3VaaWJPNmFyTG9fa2ZxTTlIYkZFeElJUnNXZUpNOXc?oc=5&quot;&gt;People Daily&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiogFBVV95cUxPeVI4eFYwdkg5OWZ4VWlya1FDNE1lbWVrRnQ5UTdPSzJiWHBlV0pNaGN6eUNCbURmZGU1X2FsQlVocXFDUVBHNHNXTmdiYXVjdkRTNzBIbWt3bTZvRUt2Y281SlEzSVMxUVdK